结论：根因是慢 SQL 导致数据库连接堆积和响应延迟  
依据：# Query_time: 38.20 Lock_time: 0.00 Rows_examined: 52000000；[Warning] Aborted connection 77001 to db: 'app' user: 'app' (Got an error reading communication packets)；{"connections": 320, "max_connections": 1000, "cpu_pct": 93, "qps": 1800, "slow_queries_per_min": 160, "row_lock_waits_per_min": 1}  
建议：1. 对涉及函数索引的查询语句进行SQL改写，避免在WHERE条件中对字段使用DATE()等函数 2. 在业务低峰期为相关大表的关键查询字段补充合适的索引

结论：根因是慢 SQL 导致数据库连接堆积和响应延迟  
依据：# Query_time: 38.20 Lock_time: 0.00 Rows_examined: 52000000；[Warning] Aborted connection 77001 to db: 'app' user: 'app' (Got an error reading communication packets)；{"connections": 320, "max_connections": 1000, "cpu_pct": 93, "qps": 1800, "slow_queries_per_min": 160, "row_lock_waits_per_min": 1}  
建议：1. 临时调大最大连接数，并排查应用有没有连接泄漏；2. 检查连接池配置，限制单个应用能占用的连接数。
